// alloc_test.vuma — Wave 6 negative test: uses `allocate(N)` (pointer syntax)
// Expected exit code: 0
//
// Default mode: compiles with a deprecation warning, runs, exits 0.
// --pmt-only mode: hard compile error (pointer syntax 'allocate' rejected).
//
// The PMT replacement is `state_new(Layout)` + a transform that performs
